{"asset_key":"mn/env_story_10304082","episode":"mn","category":"env_story","story_id":"10304082","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1030408201:1":{"text":"맞아, 병사들이 데려온 저 검은 옷의 여자가 바로 마녀야.","source_cn":"没错，士兵们带回的那个黑衣女人，就是魔女。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x98AB770DCB26F7A8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1030408202:1":{"text":"병사들이 저 여자의 손을 묶어둔 거 봤지? 마녀가 마법으로 사람들을 해치지 못하게 손을 묶어둔 거란다.","source_cn":"你没注意到吗？士兵们把她的手捆起来了，那就是为了防止她...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5D7FA1F3AF64FD24","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1030408203:1":{"text":"금빛이삭 마을의 화재도 저 여자가 일으킨 거래. 정말 못됐어...","source_cn":"听说金穗村的大火就是她引发的，真是作孽啊……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5384C841E68240FD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1030408204:1":{"text":"하지만 저렇게 예쁜 언니가 나쁜 사람일 것 같진 않아요!","source_cn":"可是，魔女姐姐那么漂亮，我不觉得她像坏人！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5821FF40CAEB5E42","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1030408205:1":{"text":"요 녀석, 외모만 보고 그렇게 쉽게 현혹되면 어떡하니!","source_cn":"你这孩子，怎么这么容易就被外表迷惑了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDCE41D213AEEF1E5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1030408206:1":{"text":"사기꾼들이 겉치장하는 이유가 바로 너처럼 순진한 아이를 속이기 위해서야.","source_cn":"很多虚伪之人，都会披上一层道貌岸然的伪装，为的就是欺骗...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC5690B137584E734","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1030408207:1":{"text":"그런데 엄마도 꽤 예쁜데...? 설마... 엄마도 절 속이는 거예요?","source_cn":"可我觉得，您也挺漂亮的，难道……您也是在骗我？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE52734731C288085","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1030408208:1":{"text":"뭐? 겨우 “꽤 예쁘다고”? 우리 아기, 가서 눈 좀 씻어야겠다.","source_cn":"噢？仅仅是“挺漂亮”吗？来，我带你回去洗洗眼睛。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2F8D65357835FD62","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:言辞犀利的母亲":{"text":"엄격한 어머니","source":"言辞犀利的母亲","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:阳光开朗小女孩":{"text":"밝고 명랑한 소녀","source":"阳光开朗小女孩","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":9,"localized_text_count":8,"speaker_count":2}}